          "text": "Kur’ uwo musi Uhoraho azomwa ku mutwe n’ubgoya bgo ku mubiri, abimweshe urupfuhe rutiwe ku mahera, ruba hakurya y’uruzi, ni rwo mwami w’i Ashuri, mbere ruzonatōtōra n’ubganwa.",
